Systematic Reviewer

Adapted from openresearchtools/systematic-reviewer, AGPL-3.0-or-later.
The complete license is in LICENSE. The frozen committed V3 source, reviewed
local changes and SHA-256 manifest are in vendor/v3; the main-branch UI reference
is in vendor/main. Source imports are immutable.

BashKitten modifications (28 October 2026): project-qualified References API,
owned-worker authorization, native Collabora edit/save/export tools, canonical
References citation identities and adapted research guidance. The donor Markdown
parser, atomic output helper and explicit-endpoint semantic ranking implementation
are retained. The former desktop integration, credential store, metadata resolvers
and DOCX serializer are not runtime dependencies. Backend services own shared
metadata, CSL, private service configuration, native Office and file persistence.
